sequenceDiagram
    participant DEV as Developer
    participant ADM as Admin Server UI
    participant EUR as Eureka
    participant SVC as Any Microservice

    DEV->>ADM: Open http://localhost:9090
    ADM->>EUR: Fetch registered instances
    EUR-->>ADM: List of services
    loop For each service
        ADM->>SVC: GET /actuator/health
        SVC-->>ADM: Health status
        ADM->>SVC: GET /actuator/metrics
        SVC-->>ADM: JVM metrics
    end
    ADM-->>DEV: Dashboard with all service statuses
